for tools that can help us with this task. They are considered the automation of static code
analysis; this technique is seen as a great opportunity to improve the software developed
and to help the developers.
The reason your developers will evolve with code analysis is that you start to disseminate
knowledge between them during code inspections. The tools that we have now have the
same purpose. Better than that, with Roslyn they do this task while you are writing the
code. Roslyn is the compiler platform for .NET, and it enables you to develop some tools
